# scripts/opcount (from the repository root, NAME ../benchmarks/apifirst/mcp/ergo):
# `mcpbench bench N` answers N tools/call lines with module mcp's Handle
# over the generated tools of counter.Counter, over a cycle of six lines
# (values, typed failures, arguments outside the schema, an unknown tool);
# the cost of one line is the slope between the two sizes. The control is
# the hand Go answer of API-FIRST spec §3's MCP row: one pass over the
# line with no encoding/json, and a switch on the tool.
unit call
sizes 20000 220000
args bench {n}
control benchmarks/apifirst/mcp/control
